'''Mr. Mer''' (マーさん ''Mā-san'', '''Mr. Mer''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

