==Existence Elsewhere==
===Kumanchu Royale===
Mr. Mer was originally from [[Kumanchu Royale]], where he was the equivalent of [[Hippoe]], meaning he had much weaker stats than in [[The Battle Cats]] and no [[Mini-Wave]]s. His name and the first sentence of his description were the same, but the second sentence was slightly different: instead of warning of his Mini-Waves, it said, "A dangerous guy who attacks multiple units at once" (一度に複数体をまとめて攻撃してくる危険なやつ), which is a reused line from Hippoe's Japanese description.
