*His animations are unchanged from [[Kumanchu Royale]], hence why they're so stiff compared to other Legend Stages enemies.
*His design is based on the Merlion statue found in Singapore.
**[[Singapore (Empire of Cats)|Singapore]]'s enemy base is a Merlion statue, inadvertently causing it to also resemble Mr. Mer far before his addition as an enemy.

